  "id": "cilantro-lime-cucumber-salad",
  "name": "Cilantro Lime Cucumber Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, chile-seasoned salad with bright citrus flavor",
  "description": "Thin cucumber strips are tossed with cilantro, lime, garlic, and chile, then rested briefly so the flavors meld.",
